    "text": "10 hours ago VALDOSTA, Ga. – Samuel Jones, of Cheyenne, has earned the Master of Music in Performance in Music Performance from Valdosta State University.\nJones was among the more than 1,100 students who achieved their academic goals and graduated from VSU at the end of spring 2026.\nEstablished in 1906, Valdosta State University is a premier comprehensive university that offers both the extensive academic, cultural, and social opportunities of a major university and the small classes and close, personal attention of smaller institutions.",
